[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "line": "Notice how you never need motivation to brush your teeth at night?",
    "word_count": 12,
    "start_sec": 0.0,
    "end_sec": 3.08,
    "duration": 3.08
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "line": "Even when you're completely exhausted, collapsing on your bed...",
    "word_count": 9,
    "start_sec": 3.08,
    "end_sec": 6.41,
    "duration": 3.33
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "line": "you still drag yourself to the sink and brush.",
    "word_count": 9,
    "start_sec": 6.41,
    "end_sec": 9.0,
    "duration": 2.59
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "line": "Why? You never asked yourself if you felt like it.",
    "word_count": 10,
    "start_sec": 9.0,
    "end_sec": 11.73,
    "duration": 2.73
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "line": "That single question is why your discipline fails.",
    "word_count": 8,
    "start_sec": 11.73,
    "end_sec": 14.3,
    "duration": 2.57
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "line": "The second you ask, \"Do I feel like working out?\"",
    "word_count": 10,
    "start_sec": 14.3,
    "end_sec": 17.66,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "line": "your brain will always vote NO.",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 17.66,
    "end_sec": 19.73,
    "duration": 2.07
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "line": "Your primitive brain hates burning energy.",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 19.73,
    "end_sec": 21.28,
    "duration": 1.55
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "line": "It's wired to choose the warm blanket.",
    "word_count": 7,
    "start_sec": 21.28,
    "end_sec": 22.85,
    "duration": 1.57
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "line": "Disciplined people don't have super-human willpower.",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 22.85,
    "end_sec": 25.23,
    "duration": 2.38
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "line": "Studies show they actually use willpower less than you.",
    "word_count": 9,
    "start_sec": 25.23,
    "end_sec": 28.01,
    "duration": 2.78
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "line": "They just removed the emotional consultation.",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 28.01,
    "end_sec": 30.35,
    "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "line": "They treat hard work like brushing their teeth.",
    "word_count": 8,
    "start_sec": 30.35,
    "end_sec": 32.48,
    "duration": 2.13
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "line": "An action so automated, it never asks for permission.",
    "word_count": 9,
    "start_sec": 32.48,
    "end_sec": 35.59,
    "duration": 3.11
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "line": "When the alarm rings, or the clock hits five...",
    "word_count": 9,
    "start_sec": 35.59,
    "end_sec": 36.63,
    "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "line": "you don't negotiate with your mood.",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 36.63,
    "end_sec": 39.53,
    "duration": 2.9
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "line": "You put your shoes on before your feelings wake up.",
    "word_count": 10,
    "start_sec": 39.53,
    "end_sec": 42.14,
    "duration": 2.61
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "line": "Action creates motivation, not the other way around.",
    "word_count": 8,
    "start_sec": 42.14,
    "end_sec": 43.8,
    "duration": 1.66
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "line": "Real discipline isn't fighting your feelings\u2014",
    "word_count": 6,
    "start_sec": 43.8,
    "end_sec": 47.09,
    "duration": 3.29
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "line": "it's treating your future like your teeth, and that's why...",
    "word_count": 10,
    "start_sec": 47.09,
    "end_sec": 49.855833,
    "duration": 2.77
  }
]